activity Collect Information
activity Examine Information
activity Compose Document
activity Assess Document
activity Edit Document
activity Authorize Document
activity Release Document
activity Gather Response
activity Formulate Measure Scheme
activity Execute Measures
bind Collect Information: Information Identifier, Information Category
bind Examine Information: Information Identifier, Effect Rating
bind Assess Document: Reviewer Identifier
bind Authorize Document: Authorization Identifier
bind Gather Response: Response Category
bind Edit Document: Edit Category
Information Identifier: integer between 1 and 10000
Information Category: Ecological, Societal, Governance
Reviewer Identifier: integer between 1 and 5000
Authorization Identifier: integer between 1 and 5000
Effect Rating: float between 0.0 and 10.0
Response Category: Favorable, Unfavorable, Impartial
Edit Category: Small, Large
Init[Collect Information] | |
End[Release Document] | |
Precedence[Examine Information, Collect Information] | | |
Chain Response[Examine Information, Compose Document] | | |
Precedence[Assess Document, Compose Document] | | |
Chain Succession[Assess Document, Edit Document] | | |
Response[Edit Document, Authorize Document] | | |0,48,h
Chain Response[Authorize Document, Release Document] | | |0,24,h
Chain Succession[Gather Response, Formulate Measure Scheme] | | |0,7,d
Chain Succession[Formulate Measure Scheme, Execute Measures] | | |0,30,d